<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Energy raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santa Fe Energy raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities raised its rating for Santa Fe Energy Resources Tuesday to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company opened up 5/16 at 10.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
